# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GARG-AML .gitignore
#
# Philosophy: commit the *code* (src/, scripts/, notebooks/) and the small
# human-facing assets (README, LICENSE, paper figures, the smurfing diagram).
# Everything that can be re-downloaded or re-generated by running the code is
# excluded, because it is either huge (the IBM transaction CSVs) or fully
# reproducible (synthetic graphs, GARG-AML score CSVs, decision-tree dumps,
# intermediate plots).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Data ------------------------------------------------------------------
# The whole data/ directory is excluded:
#   * IBM AML data (HI-Small ~0.5 GB, LI-Large ~16 GB + multi-GB zips) is far
#     too large for git and must be downloaded from Kaggle (see README).
#   * Synthetic graphs are regenerated on demand by
#     src/data/synthetic_smurfing.py, so they are reproducible, not source.
data/

# --- Generated results & artifacts -----------------------------------------
# Score matrices, timing logs, performance CSVs and the decision-tree plots are
# all produced by the scripts in scripts/. They live in these directories or as
# loose files in the repo root.
results/
results-*/
res/
lib/

# Trained models, GraphViz tree exports and per-run synthetic-tree tables.
*.pkl
*.dot
synthetic_tree_*.csv

# --- Scratch / intermediate figures ----------------------------------------
# Stray PDFs/PNGs dropped in the repo root or notebooks/ while exploring
# (ego graphs, toy examples, per-dataset score plots, etc.).
/*.pdf
/*.png
notebooks/*.pdf
notebooks/*.png

# ...but DO keep the figures that appear in the paper (Figure1.pdf,
# FigureA1.pdf, ...). They are version-controlled deliverables, not scratch.
!/Figure*.pdf

# --- Scratch / reference code ----------------------------------------------
# Early reference implementation, superseded by src/ — not part of the pipeline.
initial_code.py

# --- Exploratory / scratch notebooks ---------------------------------------
# Only the notebooks that produce paper figures/analysis are tracked
# (toyexample, VisualisationResults, VisualisationRunTime, VisualisationNetwork,
# DistributionScores). The ones below are one-off exploration, sanity checks or
# dev scratch and are kept out of git.
notebooks/AnalysisData.ipynb
notebooks/AnalysisParallel.ipynb
notebooks/AnalysisSyntheticData.ipynb
notebooks/AnomalousPatterns.ipynb
notebooks/TestCode.ipynb
notebooks/Transfer.ipynb

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/

# --- Virtual environments --------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env

# --- Jupyter ---------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- OS / editor cruft -----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
